  "Installed. It takes effect the next time Ventic starts.": "Asennettu. Astuu voimaan, kun Ventic seuraavan kerran käynnistyy.",
  "It tells most while moving around with a remote, which is where the fades stack up: on the television this was measured on, that went from 3 frames a second to 23. It starts on there, and off everywhere else.": "Se näkyy eniten kaukosäätimellä liikuttaessa, jossa häivytykset kasautuvat: televisiossa, jolla tämä mitattiin, luku nousi 3 kuvasta sekunnissa 23:een. Siellä se on päällä alusta asti ja muualla pois päältä.",
  "It was the fall that killed him.\nNot the drop — the sudden stop.": "Putoaminen se hänet tappoi.\nEi pudotus — äkillinen pysähdys.",
  "Its channels will appear under Live TV. A playlist link usually carries your account details, so it is kept out of backups.": "TODO_TRANSLATION: Its channels will appear under Live TV. A playlist link usually carries your account details, so it is kept out of backups.",
  "Its channels will appear under Live TV. The password is stored with the address and kept out of backups.": "TODO_TRANSLATION: Its channels will appear under Live TV. The password is stored with the address and kept out of backups.",
